{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"ea67b4e3-63f8-40ec-b54f-e0a8c1d9285b","step":{"id":"s1","script":"A median joins a vertex to the midpoint of the opposite side. Here, M is the midpoint of BC, so AM is a median.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"triangle","region":"left","frame":{"x":[-0.6,6.6],"y":[-0.7,5.1],"axes":"none"},"marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"a","at":[0,0],"label":"A"},{"kind":"point","id":"b","at":[6,0],"label":"B"},{"kind":"point","id":"c","at":[1.5,4.5],"label":"C"},{"kind":"polyline","points":[{"at":"a"},{"at":"b"},{"at":"c"}],"closed":true},{"kind":"point","id":"m","at":{"mid":["b","c"]},"label":"M"},{"kind":"segment","id":"am","from":{"at":"a"},"to":{"at":"m"}}]},{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"C1","content":"Medians meet at the centroid"},{"op":"equation","id":"midpoint","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"BM=MC"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"ea67b4e3-63f8-40ec-b54f-e0a8c1d9285b","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Now draw a second median, from B to the midpoint N of AC. Call the intersection G.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"second","on":"triangle","marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"n","at":{"mid":["a","c"]},"label":"N"},{"kind":"segment","id":"bn","from":{"at":"b"},"to":{"at":"n"}},{"kind":"point","id":"g","at":{"hit":["am","bn"]},"label":"G"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"midpoint_n","anchor":{"el":"midpoint","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"AN=NC"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"Where should the median from C cross the other two medians?","expected_gist":"At their intersection G"}}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"ea67b4e3-63f8-40ec-b54f-e0a8c1d9285b","step":{"id":"s3","script":"The third median also passes through G. All three meet at the centroid, which divides each median in a two-to-one ratio from the vertex.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"third","on":"triangle","marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"p","at":{"mid":["a","b"]},"label":"P"},{"kind":"segment","id":"cp","from":{"at":"c"},"to":{"at":"p"}}]},{"op":"equation","id":"midpoint_p","anchor":{"el":"midpoint_n","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"AP=PB"},{"op":"text","id":"conclusion","anchor":{"el":"midpoint_p","side":"below","gap":0.08},"content":"G is the centroid"},{"op":"equation","id":"ratio","anchor":{"el":"conclusion","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"AG:GM=BG:GN=CG:GP=2:1"}],"checkpoint":null}}
